.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-PACK 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-pack \- Export a graph, or the whole store, as a pack; or verify a pack
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu pack\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-verify\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-\-space\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-shapes\fR] [\fB\-\-queries\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\-sha\fR] [\fB\-\-model\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-model\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-destination\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-vectors\fR] [\fB\-\-full\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-missing\-embedding\-recipe\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIgraph\-iri\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export a graph, or the whole store, as a pack; or verify a pack
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-verify\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Pack file to verify without creating a new pack
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Output file
.TP
\fB\-\-space\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Namespace space recorded in pack metadata
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Name of the generated object
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Version recorded in pack metadata
.TP
\fB\-\-shapes\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Shapes used for validation or packaging
.TP
\fB\-\-queries\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Stored queries to include
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Repository identity or source root for this operation
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\-sha\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Repository commit recorded in pack provenance
.TP
\fB\-\-model\-id\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Embedding model identifier
.TP
\fB\-\-model\-version\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Embedding model version
.TP
\fB\-\-destination\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Publication destination evaluated by policy
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Output or input format for this operation
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-vectors\fR
Include embedding vectors in the pack
.TP
\fB\-\-full\fR
Include the full store or full primer, as applicable
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-missing\-embedding\-recipe\fR
Allow a pack without the embedding provider recipe
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIgraph\-iri\fR]

